    <name>Anaerobic 1min/4min 6x (47min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 7min ramp from 45% to 75% FTP, 3 x 30s fast-pedal drill @ 82%, primer 1min @ 88% + 1min @ 102% | Anaerobic capacity: 6 x (1min @ 145% / 4min @ 45%) | Cooldown: 5min from 65% to 45% FTP</description>
